      "collectionName": "material_imports",
      "description": "Admin-only publication runs and source sync checkpoints, with entries/{entryId} revisions and review/publication state. ASU2Learn uses asu2learn-respiratory for links-only discovery directly in Firestore; see docs/ASU2LEARN.md. Legacy Telegram bot runs use temporary staging until publication.",
