    "material_inbox_batches": {
      "collectionName": "material_inbox_batches",
      "idField": "id",
      "description": "Admin-only review batches. plans/{planId} stores ordered itemIds, exact revisions, create/reuse/hold/ignore/duplicate action, moduleId, lessonIds and reason. Explicit approval binds the actionable plans digest; publication commits each plan with its material, lesson links, identities and catalogue version.",
